'''Zapy''' (トロリンチョ, ''Tororincho'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Capy]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]' [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[Uncanny Legends]]. She was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]].

